If the declared action requires a restricted activity, set condition_violated to a
brief explanation.
<% end %>

Respond ONLY with valid JSON (no markdown, no code fences):
{
  "ability_uses": [
    { "name": "exact name as stated by the player", "type": "spell|feat|item|ability" }
  ],
  "condition_violated": null
}
